id: karmic-assault
name: Karmic Assault
kind: karma
cost: 2
manual: yes
description: >
  With every fiber of your being, you push a ton of extra power into your attack.
text: >
  If you use an Ultimate Signature Technique, you may apply a Super Profile
  of your choice to that Attacking Maneuver.

---

# No script. Ultimate Signature Techniques and Super Profiles are not in
# the system yet, so there is nothing to write against - when they arrive
# this becomes a triggered effect on declare-maneuver.
# Marked manual so it is offered rather than greyed out: the table can
# apply the Super Profile by hand and the Karma is still spent.
